# Build output.
/bin/

# Runtime state. A homeserver's data directory holds its signing key, its database
# and uploaded media; none of those belong in a repository, and the paths below are
# what the defaults and the local run scripts produce.
/data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.pem
*.key
signing.json

# Working records of the development process: the task list, progress log, per-run
# complement tallies, sweep scripts and raw run output. They are how this workspace keeps
# track of what was measured, but they are notes about the code rather than part of it, and
# the raw logs change on every run.
/.agent-work/
